    // We keep the base score as post_residual.

    // 2. Harmonic Dead-Space Penalty: Penalize residuals that cannot fit common item sizes
    // If post_residual is small (e.g., < 10), it creates "wasted" space.
    if post_residual > 0 && post_residual < 10 {
