    // 4. Harmonic class logic: Favor bins that leave room for specific common item sizes (e.g., 25, 33, 50).
    // We reward residuals that are exact multiples of 25 (common divisors of 100).
    if post_residual > 0 && post_residual % 25 == 0 {
